  "description": "Object-model wrapper around the Alibre Design CAD API (sessions, sketches, features, parameters, topology). Alibre.Attach() is the entry point. Built against Alibre Design 29.0.1.29069; each Alibre release can add AlibreX APIs, so use the matching Alibre version. Requires Alibre Design installed on the consumer machine; it references AlibreX.dll from the Alibre install directory at runtime and does not redistribute it.",
